<title>USA: Wilmar Industries Inc Q1 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Wilmar Industries Inc Q1 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>MOORESTOWN, N.J. 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>FOR THE 3 MOS ENDED	     MAR 28, 1997	MAR 29, 1996</p>
<p> Sales				   $   33,209	  $   19,309</p>
<p> Cost of sales			     23,214		13,373</p>
<p>   Gross profit			     9,995		 5,936</p>
<p> Operating expenses:			7,073		 4,229</p>
<p>    Operating income			2,922		 1,707</p>
<p> Interest expense (income), net	 (382)		    81</p>
<p>    Income before income taxes	  3,304		 1,626</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes (refunds) 1,232		   666</p>
<p>    Net income				2,072		   960</p>
<p> Net income per share			0.16		  0.10</p>
<p> Wgtd avg shrs			     13,319		 9,946</p>
<p>		     (In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: Wilmar completed a 4.6 million share IPO at $11 a share in January 1996 and a secondary offering of 2.6 million shares at $17.875 in July 1996.</p>
<p>The company markets and distributes repair and maintenance products, principally to the apartment housing market, and operates 16 distribution centers throughout the United States.</p>
